Monkey D.

6
00:00:21,140 --> 00:00:24,620
Luffy and his crew, the Straw Hats.

7
00:00:27,180 --> 00:00:30,017
In order to stay ahead
of these turbulent times.

8
00:00:30,100 --> 00:00:35,317
Every four years, 50 global leaders hold a
world summit in the holy land of Marijua.

9
00:00:35,400 --> 00:00:39,620
This event, known as the
reverie, is about to begin.

10
00:00:44,220 --> 00:00:48,540
The fate of the world is about
to take a dramatic new turn.

11
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:14,840
I'm drinking.

12
00:01:15,080 --> 00:01:17,837
You know I don't like to be
interrupted when I'm drinking.

13
00:01:17,920 --> 00:01:18,997
Yes, of course, sir.

14
00:01:19,080 --> 00:01:19,910
We all know.

15
00:01:20,180 --> 00:01:21,657
But, uh...

16
00:01:21,740 --> 00:01:23,840
Ma-ma-ma-ma!

17
00:01:33,700 --> 00:01:36,040
What do you want?

18
00:01:36,640 --> 00:01:38,900
I wanted to give you a warning.

19
00:01:39,640 --> 00:01:42,052
Straw Hat is on his way to you right now.

20
00:01:42,560 --> 00:01:44,520
Is that supposed to scare me?

21
00:01:44,840 --> 00:01:47,740
It shouldn't, if you
keep your hands off him.

22
00:01:49,200 --> 00:01:53,537
Just sit tight, I'll head to the land of
Wano and take care of that rat myself.

23
00:01:53,620 --> 00:01:56,757
You gotta be screwing with me, hell no!

24
00:01:56,840 --> 00:01:59,880
Don't be so sensitive, it's not about you.

25
00:02:00,720 --> 00:02:02,997
I have a personal matter
to settle with him.

26
00:02:03,080 --> 00:02:05,897
And if I don't take his head
myself, then I'll lose face.

27
00:02:05,980 --> 00:02:09,797
Beyond that, his crew took something
of mine and I want it back.

28
00:02:09,880 --> 00:02:11,260
I don't care!

29
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:15,517
If I recall, you owe me a bit of a favor?

30
00:02:15,600 --> 00:02:16,917
Do I now?

31
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:21,757
goodness don't tell me you
forgot that was a long time ago

32
00:02:21,840 --> 00:02:24,977
maybe so but it's a lifelong debt

33
00:02:25,060 --> 00:02:31,517
whatever

34
00:02:31,600 --> 00:02:32,430
grudge you have

35
00:02:32,513 --> 00:02:36,337
against this Straw Hat kid I
promise you mine is greater

36
00:02:36,420 --> 00:02:41,680
I'll be the one who kills that
punk if you test me Lin Lin

37
00:02:42,220 --> 00:02:44,860
I'll kill you too try it then.

38
00:02:45,300 --> 00:02:46,697
This is a warning.

39
00:02:46,780 --> 00:02:48,956
I didn't call to ask for your opinion

40
00:02:50,420 --> 00:02:51,600
It's fine.

41
00:02:51,900 --> 00:02:54,260
I'll lop his head off and be done.

42
00:02:54,620 --> 00:02:58,920
We should be friends just
like old times, right?

43
00:03:02,580 --> 00:03:05,877
Big mom is on the move seems
like she's going to meet up

44
00:03:05,960 --> 00:03:09,700
with Kaido I can't believe they're
using an unsecured channel.

45
00:03:09,820 --> 00:03:12,677
Surely they'd know we'd wiretapped
Them, what's their angle?

46
00:03:12,760 --> 00:03:14,357
Are they trying to provoke us?

47
00:03:14,440 --> 00:03:17,917
We should be friends just
like old times, right?

48
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:21,797
One emperor is enough trouble, but
two is just plain unmanageable.

49
00:03:21,880 --> 00:03:24,937
We would need an admiral or
a couple warlords at least,

50
00:03:25,020 --> 00:03:30,957
so you want me to go
check it out, Sakazuki?

51
00:03:31,040 --> 00:03:34,057
I think that would be a Mistake.

52
00:03:34,140 --> 00:03:38,897
This isn't one who they've got
highly skilled warriors there.

53
00:03:38,980 --> 00:03:40,940
The samurai.

54
00:03:44,800 --> 00:03:46,540
Caribou are you listening?

55
00:03:47,060 --> 00:03:49,897
Kaido and big mom are
meeting up and they're

56
00:03:49,980 --> 00:03:53,720
going after Straw Hat in
other words your grandson.

57
00:03:55,880 --> 00:03:57,080
That's funny!

58
00:03:59,200 --> 00:04:02,024
I'm afraid I don't see
the humor in this at all.

59
00:04:02,160 --> 00:04:06,520
Your grandson aside, we can't allow
two of the four emperors to team up.

60
00:04:06,960 --> 00:04:08,607
What do you expect us to do?

61
00:04:08,840 --> 00:04:11,637
Like it or not, the
reverie's going on right now.

62
00:04:11,720 --> 00:04:14,544
All our marines are busy
taking care of royalty.

63
00:04:15,140 --> 00:04:16,560
So we just sit here?

64
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:18,706
Ain't no coincidence, ma 'am.

65
00:04:19,700 --> 00:04:21,600
We're talking about Big Mom.

66
00:04:21,900 --> 00:04:24,957
She knew Tang well we'd be
short on soldiers, Otherwise,

67
00:04:25,040 --> 00:04:27,977
I reckon she wouldn't have been
so bold about this whole business.

68
00:04:28,060 --> 00:04:30,157
Yes, I'm sure you're right, but still.

69
00:04:30,240 --> 00:04:32,297
Well, what did the boss man have to say?

70
00:04:32,380 --> 00:04:35,177
He said that the land of Wano
is a non-affiliated country,

71
00:04:35,260 --> 00:04:37,201
so it's outside our jurisdiction.

72
00:04:37,300 --> 00:04:38,420
I thought so.

73
00:04:40,320 --> 00:04:42,555
Better to mind her own business, then.

74
00:04:45,520 --> 00:04:46,640
I don't know, Garp.

75
00:04:47,320 --> 00:04:49,300
If Big Mom and Kaido team up,

76
00:04:49,460 --> 00:04:52,257
the Navy will have some major
consequences to deal with.

77
00:04:52,340 --> 00:04:53,516
And you should know.

78
00:04:54,040 --> 00:04:57,040
They're the reason you were
considered a Navy hero.

79
00:04:59,280 --> 00:05:01,060
You mean the Rocks, huh?

80
00:05:02,780 --> 00:05:03,610
Funny.

81
00:05:03,693 --> 00:05:06,776
I figured you'd be too young
to know about them, Hina.

82
00:05:08,660 --> 00:05:11,940
Before Roger showed up,
it was their era for sure.

83
00:05:12,840 --> 00:05:14,577
But that was 40 years ago.

84
00:05:14,660 --> 00:05:15,940
The past is the past.

85
00:05:16,560 --> 00:05:20,560
They may have lost their captain,
but they're not any weaker for it.

86
00:05:20,660 --> 00:05:22,017
It worries me a bit.

87
00:05:22,100 --> 00:05:23,877
Eh, it's fine.

88
00:05:23,960 --> 00:05:26,297
Maybe they'll come back.

89
00:05:26,380 --> 00:05:28,137
But the world's full of maybes.

90
00:05:28,220 --> 00:05:29,937
That's what makes it so fun.

91
00:05:30,020 --> 00:05:31,960
Grinning again, are you?

92
00:05:32,380 --> 00:05:37,500
I don't get it Enter King
Stella of Goa Kingdom

93
00:06:02,340 --> 00:06:05,760
this is it the center of the world

94
00:06:20,620 --> 00:06:24,397
now make your pledge huh
can i sit on the throne

95
00:06:24,480 --> 00:06:26,777
first i don't think it's
appropriate to joke about

96
00:06:26,860 --> 00:06:30,857
such a thing no man king
or otherwise may rest

97
00:06:30,940 --> 00:06:34,480
upon that seat huh it's
called the empty throne,

98
00:06:34,860 --> 00:06:37,597
for all nations of the
world are on equal standing,

99
00:06:37,680 --> 00:06:41,157
and all rulers must pledge to
respect each other's sovereignty.

100
00:06:41,240 --> 00:06:45,897
The weapons that you see here laid
before the throne were placed there 800

101
00:06:45,980 --> 00:06:50,940
years ago to represent an oath made by
the first 20 who formed the modern world.

102
00:06:52,020 --> 00:06:54,785
This spot lies at the
very center of the world,

103
00:06:54,940 --> 00:06:58,705
and the fact that none sit upon
the throne is a symbol of peace.

104
00:06:58,880 --> 00:07:02,617
The greatest authority in the
government is held by the five elders,

105
00:07:02,700 --> 00:07:05,937
who are the highest ranking
among the Celestial Dragons.

106
00:07:06,020 --> 00:07:09,360
However, even amongst them,
that power is divided.

107
00:07:09,660 --> 00:07:12,719
There is none who would be
called King of the World.

108
00:07:16,460 --> 00:07:19,880
Now, King Stella, it's
time to make your pledge.

109
00:07:20,680 --> 00:07:24,420
If I sit on that chair, I'll
be the boss of everyone.

110
00:07:25,040 --> 00:07:26,320
Are you feeling ill?

111
00:07:27,980 --> 00:07:30,320
Let me sit there!

112
00:07:34,240 --> 00:07:36,420
Come on, let's go!

113
00:07:37,640 --> 00:07:38,640
Get away!

114
00:07:43,320 --> 00:07:45,880
I got one, I got one!

115
00:07:46,080 --> 00:07:50,020
A big, big mermaid, and she's
all mine now! Shirahoshi!

116
00:07:54,820 --> 00:07:56,420
We're not stopping him?

117
00:07:56,580 --> 00:07:59,580
I cannot abide by this no
matter the circumstances.

118
00:07:59,860 --> 00:08:01,040
We must save her!

119
00:08:04,100 --> 00:08:06,800
That's enough wiggling, Miss Fishy!

120
00:08:09,720 --> 00:08:12,100
Get those chains off! Hurry it up!

121
00:08:14,420 --> 00:08:17,020
Let her go! Careful! Stay back, princess!

122
00:08:17,320 --> 00:08:19,438
You'll get yourself killed that way!

123
00:08:20,380 --> 00:08:22,840
No, he's a celestial dragon! You can't!

124
00:08:23,120 --> 00:08:25,540
Why should I care about that? Let me go!

125
00:08:25,680 --> 00:08:27,377
Common sense doesn't apply to them!

126
00:08:27,460 --> 00:08:31,460
They'll burn down every last inch
of Dressrosa if you make them mad!

127
00:08:37,720 --> 00:08:39,720
Hey, that big jerk!

128
00:08:40,140 --> 00:08:42,680
Don't do it, Leo! Shirahoshi.

129
00:08:52,960 --> 00:08:55,320
Stop making this hard on me!

130
00:08:55,800 --> 00:08:57,920
Lay it cool, everybody!

131
00:08:59,700 --> 00:09:00,920
How'd you win?

132
00:09:09,580 --> 00:09:11,320
Nice work, Slave Three.

133
00:09:11,620 --> 00:09:15,120
Everyone will be so jealous
when they see my cute new pet.

134
00:09:17,700 --> 00:09:19,720
I can't stand by and watch this.

135
00:09:20,100 --> 00:09:22,688
How dare you do this
to Luffy Land's friend?

136
00:09:24,600 --> 00:09:25,680
Liam, no!

137
00:09:27,720 --> 00:09:29,580
Dammit, I guess this is it.

138
00:09:29,760 --> 00:09:32,297
Hold on, I'm coming for
you, Mermaid Princess!

139
00:09:32,380 --> 00:09:34,460
Someone stop that guy from Candy!

140
00:09:34,640 --> 00:09:35,740
It's not worth it!

141
00:09:39,760 --> 00:09:41,060
Let me go!

142
00:09:45,120 --> 00:09:45,950
Leo!

143
00:09:46,280 --> 00:09:48,360
Who the hell are you, creeps?

144
00:09:49,920 --> 00:09:53,340
I think some gratitude
is in order first. Kaku!

145
00:09:54,120 --> 00:09:55,520
Sorry for both zero.

146
00:09:56,780 --> 00:09:59,017
If we hadn't stopped your little outburst,

147
00:09:59,100 --> 00:10:00,797
several countries might
have met their end.

148
00:10:00,880 --> 00:10:05,540
Don't stand against the Celestial
Dragons, even a kid knows that much.

149
00:10:10,180 --> 00:10:12,997
Cypherpole is a secret
organization under the world

150
00:10:13,080 --> 00:10:16,492
government specializing in
intelligence and assassination.

151
00:10:16,720 --> 00:10:20,600
Aegis Zero is its most powerful
unit under the Celestial Dragons.

152
00:10:25,840 --> 00:10:27,000
Cy! I am!

153
00:10:29,300 --> 00:10:33,380
The celestial dragons descended from
the gods who created this world.

154
00:10:33,800 --> 00:10:36,820
Royalty or not, you exist
in a realm beneath them.

155
00:10:37,120 --> 00:10:40,885
If a god desires something of
yours, it must be granted to them.

156
00:10:41,340 --> 00:10:43,580
Finally, one of you morons gets it!

157
00:10:43,700 --> 00:10:44,994
You call this justice?

158
00:10:45,140 --> 00:10:46,437
It doesn't make any sense!

159
00:10:46,520 --> 00:10:48,920
A god is not required to make sense.

160
00:10:55,720 --> 00:10:59,377
Otohime, this can't be the
world you've dreamed of.

161
00:10:59,460 --> 00:11:02,342
Where we would live under
the same sun as humans.

162
00:11:03,760 --> 00:11:06,860
You know this isn't
right, make him stop it.

163
00:11:14,060 --> 00:11:16,317
Wait, princess of Alabasta.

164
00:11:16,400 --> 00:11:17,360
King Neptune.

165
00:11:18,580 --> 00:11:19,410
Thank you.

166
00:11:19,600 --> 00:11:23,012
I won't forget your kindness,
brief as our friendship was.

167
00:11:23,160 --> 00:11:25,840
And I'm sorry that you
have to witness this.

168
00:11:31,240 --> 00:11:35,580
I'll split their skulls and return
to the bottom of the sea for good.

169
00:11:38,660 --> 00:11:39,490
Stop it!

170
00:11:39,580 --> 00:11:41,197
I know how you feel, but you can't!

171
00:11:41,280 --> 00:11:45,417
If this is what life is like on the
surface, the dream was dead from the start!

172
00:11:45,500 --> 00:11:47,480
Loki, Neptune! You can't give up!

173
00:11:47,640 --> 00:11:51,169
Don't let the worst examples
of mankind speak for all of us!

174
00:11:54,440 --> 00:11:56,920
Forgive me, my love!

175
00:11:57,820 --> 00:11:58,650
No!

176
00:11:58,880 --> 00:12:00,740
We'll face the humans together!

177
00:12:01,540 --> 00:12:05,840
And maybe then, we can finally
make a difference for the future!

178
00:12:06,720 --> 00:12:07,777
For our children!

179
00:12:07,860 --> 00:12:08,980
For the island!

180
00:12:11,140 --> 00:12:13,360
Even if it's just a small one!

181
00:12:14,780 --> 00:12:18,820
Even if we bare our hearts
to them, humans won't change!

182
00:12:19,280 --> 00:12:21,580
I must save Shilohoshi!

183
00:12:21,860 --> 00:12:23,340
This is the only way!

184
00:12:23,880 --> 00:12:25,260
You defy me!

185
00:12:25,740 --> 00:12:28,320
Cypherpawn, kill him now! Good! Yes, sir.

186
00:12:28,480 --> 00:12:29,620
Step aside!

187
00:12:30,120 --> 00:12:32,600
Please, King Neptune, listen to reason!

188
00:12:34,480 --> 00:12:36,720
No, Father, please don't do it!

189
00:12:36,920 --> 00:12:38,744
Please don't give it to hatred!

190
00:12:53,500 --> 00:12:56,420
Someone hit a celestial
dragon! Who was that?

191
00:12:56,680 --> 00:12:58,640
I have nothing to do with this!

192
00:12:58,820 --> 00:12:59,880
Nobody look at me!

193
00:12:59,980 --> 00:13:00,810
None of you!

194
00:13:04,700 --> 00:13:09,180
As a fellow celestial dragon,
I'm ashamed to see such behavior.

195
00:13:10,380 --> 00:13:11,740
Please forgive us!

196
00:13:13,440 --> 00:13:15,180
He's a world noble, too?

197
00:13:15,780 --> 00:13:17,740
Let go of the princess, you dolt!

198
00:13:21,000 --> 00:13:22,940
My apologies to everyone.

199
00:13:23,320 --> 00:13:26,261
This fool brought savagery
to your peaceful event.

200
00:13:27,900 --> 00:13:31,782
Since you look surprised, I assume
you don't remember me, Neptune.

201
00:13:32,520 --> 00:13:35,880
But I owe the Ryugu kingdom a great debt.

202
00:13:36,080 --> 00:13:38,962
And I have been awaiting
this day for many years.

203
00:13:39,140 --> 00:13:41,081
The day that you would come here.

204
00:13:41,620 --> 00:13:43,180
Oh, no.

205
00:13:43,360 --> 00:13:44,560
It can't be.

206
00:13:46,840 --> 00:13:52,800
I'm a foolish celestial dragon who drifted
down to the Ryugu kingdom a decade ago,

207
00:13:53,160 --> 00:13:54,480
lost and injured.

208
00:13:54,880 --> 00:13:58,300
I need you to save my life, filthy fools!

209
00:13:59,620 --> 00:14:03,760
It was the eloquent words of the
late queen that gave me my humanity.

210
00:14:04,100 --> 00:14:07,220
So now I will do anything
in my power to aid you.

211
00:14:07,700 --> 00:14:11,837
King Neptune, it is my honor
to welcome you to Mariejoie.

212
00:14:11,920 --> 00:14:13,860
Go, Cypherpole!

213
00:14:14,280 --> 00:14:15,339
Retreat from here!

214
00:14:48,720 --> 00:14:50,437
You've traveled quite a long way.

215
00:14:50,520 --> 00:14:55,797
This must be important; it's the
reverie now, considering your status.

216
00:14:55,880 --> 00:14:58,597
I should think you'd have the
sense to stay out of politics,

217
00:14:58,680 --> 00:15:01,957
but we're willing to honor
your request this time.

218
00:15:02,040 --> 00:15:02,957
Thank you.

219
00:15:03,040 --> 00:15:04,257
That's very kind.

220
00:15:04,340 --> 00:15:08,757
Now then, would you
excuse us for a moment?

221
00:15:08,840 --> 00:15:09,760
Yes, sir!

222
00:15:28,740 --> 00:15:31,446
I need to speak to you
about a certain pirate.

223
00:15:39,060 --> 00:15:41,620
I'm surprised at how few people are left.

224
00:15:42,420 --> 00:15:45,302
It's hardly a surprise
after something like that.

225
00:15:45,460 --> 00:15:49,519
I doubt anyone wants to get tangled
up in unwanted trouble, you know.

226
00:15:55,120 --> 00:15:55,950
Wow!

227
00:15:56,033 --> 00:15:57,420
There, all better.

228
00:15:57,780 --> 00:15:58,740
How do you feel?

229
00:15:59,860 --> 00:16:02,660
All of the bruises have
completely disappeared.

230
00:16:03,360 --> 00:16:04,880
Thanks a lot, Manchili.

231
00:16:05,300 --> 00:16:06,771
That was just like magic.

232
00:16:07,340 --> 00:16:09,100
What a wonderful power.

233
00:16:13,280 --> 00:16:14,200
How cute.

234
00:16:14,380 --> 00:16:16,477
The biggest and the smallest princesses.

235
00:16:16,560 --> 00:16:19,325
It's quite a spectacle
to see you two together.

236
00:16:19,580 --> 00:16:21,500
I'm sorry I was afraid of you.

237
00:16:21,760 --> 00:16:23,407
That was awfully rude of me.

238
00:16:23,680 --> 00:16:25,268
It's all right, Mom Cherie.

239
00:16:25,520 --> 00:16:27,638
There's no need to beat yourself up.

240
00:16:29,840 --> 00:16:33,697
Realistically speaking, all countries
have both good and bad people.

241
00:16:33,780 --> 00:16:36,604
We fishmen are no exception
to that rule either.

242
00:16:37,080 --> 00:16:39,180
You have my gratitude, Myoscar.

243
00:16:39,360 --> 00:16:42,301
Thanks to you, I could
keep my promise to Otohime.

244
00:16:42,700 --> 00:16:44,347
There's no need to thank me.

245
00:16:44,640 --> 00:16:48,346
In fact, Neptune, consider this
payment for saving me long ago.

246
00:16:48,980 --> 00:16:53,517
During the seven-day conference, I
promised to look after Princess Shirahoshi.

247
00:16:53,600 --> 00:16:57,537
Honestly, I'm thankful my status is
finally helping someone for once.

248
00:16:57,620 --> 00:17:01,417
So then I can kick the Celestial Dragon's
butts and say that it was in order?

249
00:17:01,500 --> 00:17:04,017
I was told I was supposed to
keep my hands off of them,

250
00:17:04,100 --> 00:17:05,717
