350
00:22:52,140 --> 00:22:57,160
They have the whole Navy and CP0 on
their side, more than anyone can handle.

351
00:22:57,480 --> 00:22:59,317
We can't screw up and get caught.

352
00:22:59,400 --> 00:23:00,240
I know.

353
00:23:00,520 --> 00:23:01,500
We won't.

354
00:23:02,700 --> 00:23:05,860
Either we succeed, or die.

355
00:23:12,920 --> 00:23:16,580
The much-anticipated event,
The Reverie, commences.

356
00:23:18,460 --> 00:23:21,717
The seas of the world are divided
into four bodies of water.

357
00:23:21,800 --> 00:23:25,497
They're split one way by a massive
continental wall known as the Red Line.

358
00:23:25,580 --> 00:23:29,437
And split the other way by a dangerous
stretch of sea known as the Grand Line.

359
00:23:29,520 --> 00:23:33,285
Within these waters lies the New
World where Luffy is traveling.

360
00:23:34,340 --> 00:23:37,137
The World Government is
a massive organization

361
00:23:37,220 --> 00:23:39,037
encompassing most of the world's nations.

362
00:23:39,120 --> 00:23:41,300
170 in total.

363
00:23:42,900 --> 00:23:44,300
Every four years,

364
00:23:44,540 --> 00:23:46,997
50 Chosen Rulers are
sent to this Holy Land to

365
00:23:47,080 --> 00:23:50,021
